- A message may mix them freely:
+ Uma mensagem pode misturá-los livremente:

= A message may mix them freely:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- case class Typed
+ case class Typed

-    ( @field(1) unsigned: U32,
+    ( @field(1) unsigned: U32,

-      @field(2) signed:   S32,
+      @field(2) signed:   S32,

-      @field(3) fixed:    B32 )
+      @field(3) fixed:    B32 )

